Z||000000||Rodney||08-04-2000||07:28 PM||||We have my new web page up and running. I had asked for some help to add a few pages and some pictures and was offered a whole lot more! We had been working on my new site for some time now. That is why there have been no changes to my old site in some time. <BR> <A HREF="http://www.rodneydickman.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.rodneydickman.com</A> <P>Most of my new items are now on this new site and most have pictures. Still working on some new stuff. <P>If you click on my old website URL it will automatically forward you to my new site. <P>To order you will need to fill in the personal information page but it remembers the info and it will come up everytime after. <P>We have a shipping price system on it that we hope will work. Trying to determine a shipping charge for a multi-piece order is tough. We hope this will work out. <P>Rodney Dickman<BR>||||reg||1
